# C8 anion addition: H-bonded PS rotamer, DIHEDRAL attempt -- FAILED.
#
# Retry of the rotamer search as a dihedral scan of the C128-O130 torsion
# O129-C128-O130-O131 (the coordinate a rigid sweep shows CAN reach the
# O129...H132 H-bond, min 2.48 A near +145 deg).
#
# Fixed vs ps_rotamer_scan/: start at the seed's OWN value (-4 deg, the seed is
# at -4.18) so step 1 is the unperturbed minimum, and MaxIter 500.
#
# RESULT (2026-09-27): fatal before step 1 --
#   Decreasing the constraint accuracy, check your results carefully!
#   [Tool-GStep/qcgstep.cpp, line 521]: GSTEP: could not impose initial constraints.
# ORCA's redundant-internal-coordinate engine cannot set up a torsion about
# C128-O130 (the O129-C128-O130 unit is near-planar, so that torsion is an
# ill-conditioned internal coordinate). Not fixable by MaxIter. The distance
# scan of O129...H132 (ps_rotamer_dist/) is the working equivalent.
! QM/XTB B97-3c ddCOSMO(Water) Opt TightOpt TightSCF

%QMMM
QMATOMS
	{55 58 61 64 120 121 122 123 124 125 126 127 128 129 130 131 132}
END
Charge_total -1
Mult_total 1
AutoFF_QM2_Method GFNFF
END

%geom
  Scan
    D 129 128 130 131 = -4, 356, 24
  end
  MaxIter 500
end

%output jsonpropfile true end

%maxcore 4000

%pal
  nprocs 8
end

* xyzfile -1 1 job.xyz
